# Tracked placeholder so `infra/build/layer/python/` always exists on a clean checkout.
# `terraform plan` reads data.archive_file.lambda_layer's source_dir before any
# provisioner side effect runs, so this directory must exist ahead of time — the
# null_resource.lambda_layer_deps provisioner then populates it with the actual
# psycopg2-binary wheel contents on `terraform apply`.
